{"content_hash": "cbfa46b7c865cca3", "version_id": 1042, "article_id": 105, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Meta sells most AI glasses, but China's market is still a fight", "title_zh": "全球AI眼镜Meta一家独大，中国市场还在打混战", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8213674.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1689439518196-f48a24b49fb5?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8bWV0YXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1MzExMDg5fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Julio Lopez on Unsplash", "author": "Julio Lopez", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@juliolopez?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-holding-up-a-cell-phone-in-front-of-a-sign-ilbjfRwOgzA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(186, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(224, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "8382d9bae0e2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-22", "word_count": 142, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Meta sells more AI glasses than everyone else in the world. In China, many companies are still fighting for the top spot. Nobody has won yet.", "lead_zh": "在全球AI眼镜市场，Meta的销量远超其他所有厂商。在中国，很多公司还在争夺第一的位置，目前还没有赢家。", "preview": "In 2025, companies shipped 8.7 million AI glasses worldwide. Meta took 85.2% of that market. In China, the top three sellers are Alibaba, IN", "preview_zh": "2025年，全球AI眼镜出货量为870万副，Meta拿下了其中85.2%的市场。在中国，销量前三的是阿里巴巴、影目和小米，三家加起来还不到一半。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1025, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 56.525, "size_bytes": 340128, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 169, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 57.225, "size_bytes": 344304, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 169, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 60.625, "size_bytes": 364752, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 169, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 54.425, "size_bytes": 327456, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 169, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 56.1, "size_bytes": 337536, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 169, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/1042.json", "paragraphs": ["In 2025, companies shipped 8.7 million AI glasses worldwide. Meta took 85.2% of that market. In China, the top three sellers are Alibaba, INMO and Xiaomi. Together they hold less than half of the market.", "China's market is also slowing. In the second quarter of 2026, Chinese shipments fell 8% from a year earlier. That was the first drop. Glasses without a screen sold badly, while AR glasses with a display grew fast.", "One big problem is comfort. About 30% of smart glasses come back from online buyers. Some products have a 70% return rate. Many AI features are rarely used. People mostly use simple things like weather and news.", "Meta has a strong partner, EssilorLuxottica. It makes Ray-Ban glasses and has stores worldwide. Meta also has money to keep spending. Chinese startups like XREAL still lose money and must raise more."], "paragraphs_zh": ["2025年，全球AI眼镜出货量为870万副，Meta拿下了其中85.2%的市场。在中国，销量前三的是阿里巴巴、影目和小米，三家加起来还不到一半。", "中国市场也在放缓。2026年第二季度，中国出货量同比下降8%，这是首次下滑。无屏眼镜卖得不好，而带显示的AR眼镜增长很快。", "一个大问题是佩戴舒适度。线上购买的智能眼镜约有30%被退货，个别产品退货率高达70%。很多AI功能很少被使用，用户常用的还是天气、新闻这些简单功能。", "Meta有一个强大的伙伴依视路陆逊梯卡，它生产雷朋眼镜，并在全球拥有门店。Meta也有钱持续投入。XREAL这样的中国创业公司仍在亏损，必须不断融资。"], "body": "In 2025, companies shipped 8.7 million AI glasses worldwide. Meta took 85.2% of that market. In China, the top three sellers are Alibaba, INMO and Xiaomi. Together they hold less than half of the market.\n\nChina's market is also slowing. In the second quarter of 2026, Chinese shipments fell 8% from a year earlier. That was the first drop. Glasses without a screen sold badly, while AR glasses with a display grew fast.\n\nOne big problem is comfort. About 30% of smart glasses come back from online buyers. Some products have a 70% return rate. Many AI features are rarely used. People mostly use simple things like weather and news.\n\nMeta has a strong partner, EssilorLuxottica. It makes Ray-Ban glasses and has stores worldwide. Meta also has money to keep spending. Chinese startups like XREAL still lose money and must raise more.", "body_zh": "2025年，全球AI眼镜出货量为870万副，Meta拿下了其中85.2%的市场。在中国，销量前三的是阿里巴巴、影目和小米，三家加起来还不到一半。\n\n中国市场也在放缓。2026年第二季度，中国出货量同比下降8%，这是首次下滑。无屏眼镜卖得不好，而带显示的AR眼镜增长很快。\n\n一个大问题是佩戴舒适度。线上购买的智能眼镜约有30%被退货，个别产品退货率高达70%。很多AI功能很少被使用，用户常用的还是天气、新闻这些简单功能。\n\nMeta有一个强大的伙伴依视路陆逊梯卡，它生产雷朋眼镜，并在全球拥有门店。Meta也有钱持续投入。XREAL这样的中国创业公司仍在亏损，必须不断融资。", "text": "In 2025, companies shipped 8.7 million AI glasses worldwide. Meta took 85.2% of that market. In China, the top three sellers are Alibaba, INMO and Xiaomi. Together they hold less than half of the market. China's market is also slowing. In the second quarter of 2026, Chinese shipments fell 8% from a year earlier. That was the first drop. Glasses without a screen sold badly, while AR glasses with a display grew fast. One big problem is comfort. About 30% of smart glasses come back from online buyers. Some products have a 70% return rate. Many AI features are rarely used. People mostly use simple things like weather and news. Meta has a strong partner, EssilorLuxottica. It makes Ray-Ban glasses and has stores worldwide. Meta also has money to keep spending. Chinese startups like XREAL still lose money and must raise more.", "vocab": [{"word": "ship", "pos": "verb", "zh": "出货；发货", "note": "商业语境中指把产品卖到市场", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "market share", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "市场份额", "note": "常用搭配 take/hold market share", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drop", "pos": "noun", "zh": "下降", "note": "a drop in sales 销量下降", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "display", "pos": "noun", "zh": "显示屏", "note": "glasses with a display 带显示屏的眼镜", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "comfort", "pos": "noun", "zh": "舒适度", "note": "佩戴体验常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "return", "pos": "noun", "zh": "退货", "note": "return rate 退货率", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "feature", "pos": "noun", "zh": "功能", "note": "产品功能", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "raise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "筹集（资金）", "note": "raise money 融资", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-22T01:31:27.743031", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "In", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.35, "sm": 250, "em": 349, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "2025", "s": 0.35, "e": 1.275, "sm": 350, "em": 1275, "cs": 3, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": ",", "s": 1.275, "e": 1.35, "sm": 1275, "em": 1349, "cs": 7, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "companies", "s": 1.35, "e": 1.812, "sm": 1350, "em": 1812, "cs": 9, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "shipped", "s": 1.812, "e": 2.112, "sm": 1812, "em": 2112, "cs": 19, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "8.7", "s": 2.112, "e": 2.875, "sm": 2112, "em": 2875, "cs": 27, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "million", 